lved cut surfaces \u000ademonstrate minimal white, nodular, fibrous areas and lobulated adipose tissue. \u000aThe specimen is entirely submitted from anterior to posterior as follows: \u000a \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Anterior end margin. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Uninvolved medial section. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Mass to inferior and medial margins. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Remainder of mass, entirely submitted. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Uninvolved section immediately posterior to mass. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Uninvolved posterior. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Posterior end margin. \u000a \u000aFinal Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M.D., Electronically signed on Tuesday \u000aREMOVED_MONTH 20,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 10:05:47AM \u000aBy his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final \u000aDiagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed \u000aor corrected the diagnoses. \u000a \u000aPART : Breast (Left), Excision \u000a \u000a \u000a[report_end] 
