e medial, \u000a1.0cm from the posterior, 1.5cm from the lateral, & >2.0cm from the \u000asuperior-inferior margins. Representative sections are submitted sequentially \u000afrom superior to inferior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , with the nodular, fibrotic area in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , \u000asuperior margin en face in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and inferior margin en face in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000a \u000a \u000a \u000a \u000aPART : BREAST EXCISION, LEFT \u000a \u000a \u000a[report_end] 
