N_ID : Opposite end margins, en face. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Mottled hemorrhage. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative away from mottled hemorrhage. \u000a \u000aC. Labeled "right scar", is a tan-pink, fibrous, REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm skin, from \u000awhich representative sections are submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aD. Labeled "right breast margin medial", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.0cm fibroadipose \u000atissue oriented with a suture on one broad surface designating the new final \u000amargin. The new final margin is inked and the specimen is sectioned to show \u000auniform, tan-pink glistening cut surfaces. The specimen is submitted entirely \u000ain cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aE. Labeled "right breast margin deep", is a rectangular REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.0cm \u000afibroadipose tissue oriented with a suture on one broad surface designating the \u000anew final margin. The new final margin is inked and the specimen is sectioned \u000ato show uniform, yellow, glistening cut surfaces. The specimen is submitted \u000aentirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aF. Labeled "right breast margin superior", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.9cm fibroadipose \u000atissue oriented with a suture on one broad surface designating the new final \u000amargin. The new final margin is inked and the specimen is sectioned to show \u000auniform, yellow, glistening unremarkable cut surfaces. The specimen is \u000asubmitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aG. Labeled "right breast margin inferior", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.4cm fibroadipose \u000atissue oriented with a suture on one broad surface designating the new final \u000amargin. The new final margin is inked and the specimen is sectioned to show \u000auniform, tan-pink fibrous surfaces. The specimen is submitted entirely in \u000acassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aH. Labeled 