0aspecimen is bisected and entirely frozen as FX#2 and 2A, now  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aC. Received fresh, labeled "right simple mastectomy, stitch long lateral, short \u000asuperior," is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3.4cm mastectomy specimen with a short suture \u000adesignating the superior aspect and a long suture designating the lateral \u000aaspect. No overlying ellipse of skin is identified. The anterior surface is \u000ainked blue and the posterior is inked black. The specimen is serially sectioned \u000ato reveal unremarkable fatty cut surfaces with extensive dense fibrous tissue \u000aand scattered blue cysts measuring up to 0.2cm  No masses or lesions are \u000aidentified. No palpable lymph nodes are identified in the lateral soft tissue. \u000aThe specimen was examined by Dr. Travis Rice-Stitt. Representative sections are \u000asubmitted as follows: \u000a \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Upper outer quadrant. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lower outer quadrant. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Upper inner quadrant. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lower inner quadrant. \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Central breast. \u000aD. Received fresh, labeled "right nipple margin", are 2 fragments of fibrofatty \u000asoft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.1cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.2cm  The surfaces \u000aare inked black. The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aE. Received fresh, labeled "left nipple margin", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm piece \u000aof tan-white soft tissue, which is inked black. The specimen is entirely \u000asubmitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aF. Received fresh, labeled "left simple mastectomy, stitch-long lateral, \u000ashort-superior", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3.5cm mastectomy specimen with a short \u000asuture designating superior and a long suture designating lateral. There is no \u000aoverlying skin. The anterior margin is inked