lip as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received fresh,  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME , REMOVE_MRN and "left breast re-excision", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.1cm portion of tan-red fibrofatty tissue with no orientation. The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal hemorrhage and focally dense gray-white fibrous tissue. Also noted is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm nodular tan-pink granular area consistent with previous biopsy site which abuts the ink. The specimen is entirely submitted from one end to the alternate end as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , with the end margins en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and the entire previous biopsy site as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (LEFT),RE- EXCISION [report_end] 
