inman with a date of birth of REMOVED_DATE and having a site listed as "R. \u000aabdomen" is a flat irregularly shaped specimen of tan skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm that has been excised to a depth of < 0.1cm  The surface of the specimen is \u000asmooth and glistening. There is a centrally located smooth, glistening, \u000aslightly domed yellowish tan lesion measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.1cm  The surgical \u000amargins are inked blue; the specimen is bisected and submitted entirely in a \u000asingle cassette labeled  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000a \u000aTissue shrinks when placed in formalin. Therefore, the original sample size may \u000abe larger than noted above. \u000a \u000aLisa Harbury Lerner, MD \u000a(Electronic Signature) \u000a2/19/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  12:38 \u000a \u000a \u000aCPT Code(s): \u000aA:  REMOVED_CASE_ID - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ,  REMOVED_CASE_ID -SSI \u000a \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Code(s): \u000a702.11 \u000a \u000a \u000a \u000aPART : SHAVE, R ABDOMEN (2/18/14) \u000a \u000a \u000a[report_end] 
