ed with packing material. There are slightly fibrous regions in the superior lateral portion of the specimen, surrounding the biopsy tract, while most of this specimen is adipose. Representative sections are submitted: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin, representative sections radially.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #2, biopsy tract, superior margin.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #3.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Contiguous sections of slice #5.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #4.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial margin, representative sections radially. Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION [report_end] 
